# Anchored to the repo root and to setuptools' own generated file. The stock
# unanchored `MANIFEST` pattern matches at ANY depth, and git ignore matching is
# case-insensitive here (core.ignorecase=true on Windows), so it silently
# swallows any file or directory named `manifest` anywhere in the tree --
# shipped template directories included. That is invisible locally (the files
# exist and the tests pass) and only surfaces as a package that cannot generate
# after a clone or a wheel install.
/MANIFEST

# PyInstaller
#  Usually these files are written by a python script from a template
#  before PyInstaller builds the exe, so as to inject date/other infos into it.
*.manifest
*.spec

